You can apply single tag filter like `tags=tag1` or build nested conditions using logical operators - `and`, `or`, `not`, `exists`.

Example:
```
tags=admin
tags={"or":[{"and":["admin","sales"]},{"and":["admin","manager"]}]}
tags={"not":"admin"}
tags={"exists":true}

